the depth of the material. UNITS ARE IN KG OF WATER PER KG OF DRY MATERIAL. (Default: 0)</item>
                            <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">bc7bca7a-688b-4850-9e17-662340b76ae0</item>
                            <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">_initial_w_</item>
